      "content": "i get what you're saying but i really dont want to deal with an er visit right now, it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure i'm just stressed out. if its just bells palsy, can i just try taking some high dose vitamin b or maybe some steroids at home to see if that helps first? like, how can i tell for sure if it's just a minor nerve issue without going in?",
